 will set her on the path to a bat career  but birds-of-prey screenwriter Christina  Hudson is also in charge of the Batgirl  script notably it does not appear that  Jared Leto will be reprising his joke  in any way whatsoever as the Clown  Prince himself would say I am NOT  someone who is  you and McGregor will be the major  antagonist of the film as black mask AKA  roman sionis a long time batman villain  like so many Batman villains he's a kind  of Dark Mirror to Bruce Wayne raised in  extreme wealth by industrialists parents  who never loved him and who also died  mysteriously he took over the family  business only to destroy it which led  Wayne Enterprises to purchase the  business out from under him consumed  with rage and a thirst for revenge he  turned to growing a crime syndicate  called the false facers and rose to  become one of the most prominent mob  bosses in Gotham City rumor has surfaced  that birds of prey will make a major  diversion in black mask's character to  portray him as a man who openly flirts  with secondary villain Victor Zsasz  Chris Messina best known for his role as  Danny Castellano in the Mindy project  has traded his boy next door rom-com  charm for a role so different that  describing it as polar opposites still  somewhat misses the mark Victor Zsasz as  a frequent inmate at Gotham's iconic  Arkham Asylum says is the ultimate  over-the-top presentation of a  nihilistic serial killer he marked scars  and his skin as tallies for each of his  kills and considers his murders to be a  gift liberating his victims from the  emptiness of existence based on the  trailer footage released so far it seems  like he will be working as black mask's  main Lackey chasing down the birds of  prey that is pretty consistent with the  character's role in the comics as zazz  is relatively straightforward violence  often makes him an excellent distraction  to be deployed by more cerebral Batman  villains  additionally Robert Katrina has been  cast as a character named stefano  Galante some have suggested that  Katrina's character may be a combination  of two characters from other Mafia  families prominent in Batman Canon  Stefano magic aura and jr. Galante the  Meldrick Ora family are chiefly  responsible for the murder of huntresses  mother suggesting that a whole lot of  potential character motivation is set to  unfold in birds of prey  Kathy Yin has been brought on as  director for birds of prey which makes  her the first Asian woman to direct a  superhero film  she began her professional life as a  reporter for The Wall Street Journal and  the LA Times before turning her eye to  film the result was a bridge between her  two careers with dead pigs a  fictionalized take on a guardian news  story about tens of thousands of dead  pigs found in the Huangpu River the film  was featured and lauded at the Sundance  Film Festival in 2018 John wick director  chads2 house key is serving as a second  unit director with a specific task of  expanding action sequences according to  The Hollywood Reporter's to hausky will  apparently be uncredited though fans  often see reshoots as a red flag there's  nothing too unusual at play here second  unit photography is a standard process  and Sahel Skees 8711 studio has been  assisting with birds of prey stunt  coordination from the beginning heavily  stylized in-your-face fighting sequences  are Sahel skis bread and butter so his  stylistic touch being added to what  already looks to be a bold visually  striking film is promising Cristina  Hudson coming off the surprise success  of the Transformers franchise's latest  offering bumblebee has written the  screenplay for birds of prey  Hudson must have developed quite a  kinship both with Margot Robbie and her  passion project as the two of them have  been chipping away at the screenplay for  three years  meeting Robbie and working on the  project took Hudson on what she called a  deep deep dive of DC Canon after growing  up as a Batman fan to say she's having a  great couple of years would be an  understatement  she's also been tapped to pen the  upcoming Batgirl script in the wake of  Joss Whedon's exit from the project  Hudson has been racking up accolades and  rapidly becoming the must-have  screenwriter of the industry with three  unproduced scripts on the blacklist  between 2012 and 2014 a rumored synopsis  in 2018 suggested that birds of prey  would find Harley Quinn breaking up with  the Joker and then teaming up with Black  Canary Huntress and Renee Montoya to  rescue a young Cassandra Kane from the  clutches of an evil crime lord at the  time of the original reporting Ewan  McGregor had not yet been cast and Black  Mask  even been publicly considered as a  character apparently the originally  intended big bad many drafts ago was the  penguin birds of prey comics are usually  serialized as vigilante missions so any  story to draw from them comes largely  through character backgrounds and  incidental moments as opposed to  overarching plot there's one bit of  rumored truly bizarre content floating  around the internet though without any  context it's both difficult to believe  or understand according to a couple of  alleged plot leaks the MacGuffin of the  film is rumored to be a collection of  nude pictures of black masks that  Cassandra Cain gets ahold of and then  eats to hide the evidence no that's not  all the pictures are somehow stored in a  diamond this is a rumor of course and  hopefully you will work better than it  sounds there's plenty we still don't  know about birds of prey but we  certainly know what it looks like  punkish irreverent and glitzy the first  teaser features the German house group  moderates his song a new error overripe  it cuts between the main characters  hanging out in costume hardly of course  is most eclectically dressed in  something like a yellow wrapper or  overalls and wearing a coat made of  holographic streamer material her  friends Black Canary and Huntress appear  in slick leather looking annoyed with  everything going on around them Victor  says without his usual visible scar  tallies and black mask smugly mug at the  camera it's more costume test than  trailer but it does just enough to hint  at the movie's vibe  the official birds of prey Instagram  announced a surprise trailer in early  October 20 19 in addition to four shiny  new posters featuring Harley when the  trailer went live online the next day we  were treated to a series of trailer  typical fast cuts of action mixed with  some establishing shots of all the  principal characters all dubbed over by  a monologue from Harley herself the  trailer is a relative feast compared to  the sneak peeks we'd had previously the  movies theme of emancipation isn't just  for Harley but for all the women on her  side united against black masks  Harley alludes to the fact that both she  and black Canary are Harlequins faceless  servants subject to master  Harley may be the star but it doesn't  seem like she's the only one trying to  carve out a new place for herself  Cassandra Cain is apparently on the run  from Black Mask and Victor Zsasz it's  unclear right now if Huntress is more  connected to Stefano Galante than black  mask but that's somewhat irrelevant as  the mobster is clearly working with him  Renee Montoya is introduced carrying a  box suggesting that she is either  quitting or has been fired from the  police force in short it's the kind of  wholesome story of sisterhood we can all  get behind a group of messy women drawn  together by fate to escape a monster  trying to catch them at New York  comic-con 2019 margot robbie gave an  interview to DC daily along with jurnee  smollett val Rosie Perez and Ellijay  Vasco in it characterization became  center focus with questions posed to  each woman about their place in the film  with emancipation being an overall theme  Perez talked about detective Montoya's  need to free herself from the  patriarchal oppression she experiences  in the police department of course  Montoya's character is more complex than  just feeling stifled as a police officer  she has a flaws too sometimes she will  do anything to you know make sure that  she meets her agenda it sounds like a  kind of chaotic good alignment justice  at any cost  Smollett Val described flat canary as a  person needing emancipation of the self  a woman who feels uncomfortable in her  own skin and specifically with her  powers her journey is about mastering  her ability and her identity in order to  find purpose Vasco says Cassandra Kane  is a street-smart take no guff girl who  is eminently capable of manipulation of  everyone around her friend or foe this  is a particular turn given the fact that  the plot summarizes her as needing  rescue she may be in danger but she's  clearly still determined to look out for  number one and Harlee according to  Robbie the story is told from Hartley's  point of view and that means color drama  and a wildly unreliable narrator but at  its heart this movie is guided by the  premise that women can save each other  catch birds of prey when it arrives  theaters on February 7th 2020 check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite movies are coming soon  subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

